        "html": "<div class=\"wrap\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;min-height:560px;max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px;gap:0;align-items:stretch;\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:72px 48px 72px 0;border-right:1px solid #E8DCCB;\">\n    <div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:#2C1A0E;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:3px;margin-bottom:32px;align-self:flex-start;\">\n      <span style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#C17F3B;display:inline-block;\"></span>\n      <small style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.16em;color:#F5EFE6;text-transform:uppercase;\">신규 코스 오픈</small>\n    </div>\n    <h1 style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:clamp(32px,4.5vw,56px);font-weight:900;line-height:1.08;color:#0F0D0B;margin:0 0 20px;\">\n      지금 당장<br>\n      온보딩 문서를<br>\n      <span style=\"color:#C17F3B;\">Claude에게<br>맡기세요.</span>\n    </h1>\n    <p style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#3D2D1E;max-width:420px;margin:0 0 36px;\">\n      채용 후 첫날부터 팀원이 스스로 읽고 실행할 수 있는\n      SOP를 — 당신의 언어로, AI가 대신 씁니다.\n    </p>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-bottom:44px;\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\">\n        <span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#C17F3B;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:11px;color:#fff;font-weight:800;\">✓</span>\n        </span>\n        <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#2C1A0E;\">구두 설명 반복 제거</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\">\n        <span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#C17F3B;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:11px;color:#fff;font-weight:800;\">✓</span>\n        </span>\n        <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#2C1A0E;\">내 말투·기준이 그대로 반영된 문서</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;\">\n        <span style=\"width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:#C17F3B;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:11px;color:#fff;font-weight:800;\">✓</span>\n        </span>\n        <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#2C1A0E;\">당일 완성 가능한 실전 워크플로우</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <a href=\"#enroll\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#C17F3B;color:#0F0D0B;font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;padding:18px 40px;border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:0.01em;align-self:flex-start;\">지금 바로 시작하기 →</a>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;padding:72px 0 72px 48px;gap:24px;\">\n    <figure style=\"margin:0;width:100%;max-width:400px;\">\n      <img src=\"/assets/placeholder/hero-sop-visual.svg\" alt=\"SOP 자동화 흐름 일러스트\" style=\"width:100%;height:320px;object-fit:contain;border-radius:8px;background:#E8DCCB;\" />\n      <figcaption style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#7A6252;margin-top:12px;text-align:center;\">Claude가 인터뷰 → 구조화 → 문서 완성까지 처리</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n    <blockquote style=\"margin:0;background:#fff8f0;border-left:3px solid #C17F3B;padding:16px 20px;border-radius:0 6px 6px 0;max-width:400px;width:100%;\">\n      <p style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#2C1A0E;margin:0 0 8px;\">&ldquo;처음 팀원 뽑고 나서 2주를 설명만 하다 날렸어요.\n      이젠 문서 링크 하나 보내면 끝입니다.&rdquo;</p>\n      <small style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#8C6A4A;font-weight:600;\">— 콘텐츠 사업 운영자, 수강생 후기</small>\n    </blockquote>\n  </div>\n</div>",
