ding:17px 40px;border-radius:50px;text-decoration:none;\">무료 맛보기 강의 보기</a>\n    <a href=\"#curriculum\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:transparent;border:1.5px solid #C4A06A;color:#5C3A1E;font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;padding:17px 36px;border-radius:50px;text-decoration:none;\">전체 커리큘럼 확인</a>\n  </div>\n  <figure style=\"margin:0;width:100%;max-width:680px;\">\n    <img src=\"/assets/placeholder/hero-narrative-scene.svg\" alt=\"온보딩 자동화 흐름 시각화\" style=\"width:100%;height:280px;object-fit:contain;background:#F2E8D9;border-radius:12px;\" />\n    <figcaption style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#9A7A58;margin-top:14px;\">\n      인터뷰 → Claude 프롬프트 → SOP 초안 → 팀 공유까지, 하루 안에 완성\n    </figcaption>\n  </figure>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:32px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:48px;padding-top:40px;border-top:1px solid #EAD9C3;\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px;\">\n      <strong style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#221A12;\">문서 작성 경험</strong>\n      <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#9A7A58;\">불필요 — Claude가 합니다</span>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"width:1px;background:#EAD9C3;\"></div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px;\">\n      <strong style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#221A12;\">소요 시간</strong>\n      <span style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#9A7A58;\">첫 SOP 초안 완성 6시간</span>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"width:1px;background:#EAD9C3;\"></div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:4px;\">\n      <strong style=\"font-family:'Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#221A12;\">대상</strong>\n      <span style=\"